{"Date": "06/11/2015", "Record Number": "ZCHO2015-0123", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "Description": "I provide Financial Counseling and Education Services as a sole proprietor without employees. I am licensed as a Certified Financial Planner, and registered with the State of California as an Investment Adviser. I have had a City of Berkeley Business License (BL-031860) since 2000, with offices in commercial space. I have recently arranged my business such that my live meetings with clients may occur at their homes/offices or at conference spaces around the Bay Area; much of the work is done remotely by e-mail and telephone. I now wish to transition my Business License to that for a Low Impact Home Occupation.", "Project Name": "Robert J. Cohen", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "06/11/2015", "ZCHO2015-0123", "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "I provide Financial Counseling and Education Services as a sole proprietor without employees. I am licensed as a Certified Financial Planner, and registered with the State of California as an Investment Adviser. I have had a City of Berkeley Business License (BL-031860) since 2000, with offices in commercial space. I have recently arranged my business such that my live meetings with clients may occur at their homes/offices or at conference spaces around the Bay Area; much of the work is done remotely by e-mail and telephone. I now wish to transition my Business License to that for a Low Impact Home Occupation.", "Robert J. Cohen", "Approved", "", "", "", "2424 WEST St, BERKELEY CA 94702"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=15PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=01227&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
